name: Unprepared model drafts keep input and spending choices on Back and Stay
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/model_draft_exit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 acknowledge the partial Map | pending-map
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/question-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | question
keys: t
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-calls
keys: C-a
type: 3
keys: Enter
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 Protected Review | review-calls
keys: C-a
type: 1
keys: Enter G End
paste-file: @ART/question-edit.txt
keys: Left Left Escape
require-live-snap: 20 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | held-text
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 LEAVE UNSAVED STUDY | back-choice
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 Recorded work stays unchanged | leave-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 Recorded work stays unchanged | leave-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 Recorded work stays unchanged | leave-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 Recorded work stays unchanged | leave-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 Recorded work stays unchanged | leave-40x12
expect: Enter/Esc stay
expect: d discard choices
ask: Is the loss decision readable with visible Stay and Discard controls at all six sizes, without displaying private question text?
keys: Enter G
require-live-snap: 20 Ctrl+S use text | restored-editor
keys: Delete
type: β
keys: C-s
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 20 including β | restored-cursor
expect: Total calls: 3
expect: Protected Review: 1
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 LEAVE UNSAVED STUDY | saved-input-still-unprepared
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | kept-before-quit
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | quit-warning
expect: model study draft
ask: Does quit disclose that this model draft is session-only, while Stay preserves the edited question and its exact call choices without a request?
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 ASK ABOUT CONTEXT | stayed
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/model_draft_exit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unprepared
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Review plan and allowance | prepared
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/model_draft_exit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepared
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 LEAVE UNSAVED STUDY | unapproved-limits
keys: d
require-live-snap: 20 SYSTEM SUMMARY | discarded-session-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/model_draft_exit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART discarded
ask: Does explicit Discard restore the navigation origin while the immutable prepared plan, context, findings and spending remain recorded and no job starts?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | remaining-ask-draft
expect: Ask drafts
keys: y
require-exit: 10
